.TH QUICK-HK-DEPLOYER 1 "September 2026" "YueKey 0.3.0"
.SH NAME
quick-hk-deployer \- compile a staged YueKey Rime profile
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B quick-hk-deployer --build
.I USER_DIR SHARED_DIR BUILD_DIR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compile the YueKey schema and shared default configuration in a staging
directory. Used internally by quick-hk; prefer quick-hk deploy for normal use.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR quick-hk (1)
